    "problems": "The experiments report accuracy, not training–test error gaps or memorization of random labels. The main text uses historical best accuracy for comparison; Appendix B.4 says baseline replication produced performance fluctuations and includes new and prior results. Some ablation comparisons lack reported uncertainty.",
    "rows_left_out": "Table 1 contains additional method-by-condition results beyond the selected FedSAM and FedTOGA rows; Table 2 has additional method and condition values. These were left out to keep the extraction focused on paired SAM/FedTOGA accuracy and the reported module ablations; no rows were omitted from Table 10.",
